<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587854692152-cbe660dbde88?w=1600&q=80');" aria-label="BasaRx Pharmacy and EHR Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Pharmacy · EHR · Healthcare ERP</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">BasaRx</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            One platform for the counter, the clinic, and the ledger. BasaRx unifies pharmacy
            dispensing, electronic health records, inventory, medical aid, and finance so retail
            pharmacies, clinics, and hospitals run as a single ERP — not a stack of disconnected tools.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Explore capabilities</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request a demo</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">One patient. One ledger.</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Full EHR and pharmacy on one ERP</h2>
        <p>
            BasaRx treats clinical care and retail pharmacy as the same business system. Patients are
            shared across the counter and the consulting room. Medicines live in one catalogue with
            FEFO batch control. Dispenses and prescriptions are real financial documents — permanent
            <code>RX-</code> script numbers at create time — that post stock movements and accounting
            entries without re-keying.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            From SOAP encounters and lab orders to pharmacist verification, label printing, POS
            shortfalls, and medical-aid remittances, every step stays on the same platform your
            finance and stock teams already trust.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="vitrum-container module-feature-img border-0">
            <img src="~/images/vitrum/yellow-pink-glass-heart.webp" alt="Pharmacy and clinical care connected on one platform" class="vitrum-img" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

